00:08:53.665 --> 00:08:55.601 size:78% position:39%
<i> You can save your money,
 and then move back out.</i>

00:08:55.634 --> 00:08:56.602
Ma,

00:08:57.803 --> 00:08:59.539
I'm not changing my mind.

00:09:01.073 --> 00:09:02.108
Thanks, though.

00:09:06.144 --> 00:09:08.647 align:start size:66% position:34%
I just hope she knows
how much I loved her.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.149 align:start size:88% position:13%
Who? Gi'gel?

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:11.183 align:start size:38% position:63%
Mm-hmm.

00:09:11.216 --> 00:09:12.284 align:start size:88% position:13%
Aw.

00:09:12.317 --> 00:09:13.986 align:start position:0%
She knows, Paul.

00:09:14.019 --> 00:09:15.087 align:start size:88% position:13%
She knows.

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:16.655
- Thanks.
- Mm-hmm.

00:09:16.688 --> 00:09:18.023 align:start size:75% position:25%
Mo:
Today was tough.

00:09:18.056 --> 00:09:19.592
It's like

00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:21.360
when everybody tells you
to follow your dreams,

00:09:21.393 --> 00:09:22.761
no one tells you how fast

00:09:22.794 --> 00:09:24.129
they're running
away from you.

00:09:24.162 --> 00:09:25.898
- Is he rehearsing again?
- Mmm. Sounds like it,

00:09:25.931 --> 00:09:28.167 align:start position:0%
but whatever it is,
I hope he gets the role.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.635 align:start position:0%
Be good for him.

00:09:29.668 --> 00:09:31.804
In every story you read,

00:09:31.837 --> 00:09:33.606
every-- every biography

00:09:33.639 --> 00:09:35.641
is all told from
a point of success.

00:09:35.674 --> 00:09:38.310 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
Uh, I guess they don't
write biographies

00:09:38.343 --> 00:09:40.746 align:start size:81% position:19% line:0%
about people
who didn't make it.

00:09:40.779 --> 00:09:42.682 line:0%
I'm not complaining.

00:09:43.949 --> 00:09:45.351
Complaining's not going to...

00:09:46.818 --> 00:09:49.188
help me pay my mom back

00:09:49.221 --> 00:09:52.592 align:start size:88% position:13%
or get me that life
that I'm trying to live.

00:09:54.326 --> 00:09:56.195 align:start size:91% position:9% line:0%
Plus,
complaining's for losers,

00:09:56.228 --> 00:09:57.630 line:0%
and I'm from Philly, man.

00:09:57.663 --> 00:09:59.365 align:start size:78% position:22% line:0%
I don't lose
at anything, so...

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.168 line:0%
[sigh]

00:10:03.201 --> 00:10:05.004 line:0%
But you know what?

00:10:07.806 --> 00:10:09.241 align:start size:78% position:22%
I'm just going
to keep working...

00:10:10.742 --> 00:10:12.078
and keep believing.

00:10:16.948 --> 00:10:18.317
And we're going to make it.

00:10:20.952 --> 00:10:22.622 line:0%
I truly believe that.

00:10:25.424 --> 00:10:26.959 line:0%
We're going to make it.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.333 align:start size:75% position:25%
You know, guys,
I'm really sorry about--

